{"ticker":"CSGP","updated":"2026-11-06T23:06:19Z","profile":{"longName":"CoStar Group, Inc.","shortName":"CoStar Group, Inc.","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"Real Estate Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.costargroup.com","fullTimeEmployees":8441,"marketCap":12291405824,"trailingPE":71.04651,"forwardPE":17.266716,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.3455107,"pegRatio":0.13,"targetMeanPrice":35.85,"targetHighPrice":50.0,"targetLowPrice":26.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.141,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.78306997,"operatingMargins":0.088240005,"profitMargins":0.048720002,"totalRevenue":3673999872,"beta":0.78,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":70.57,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":25.89,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"CoStar Group, Inc. provides information, analytics, and online marketplace services to real estate and related business communities in the United States, Australia, Canada, Europe, the Asia Pacific, and Latin America. It offers CoStar Property that provides inventory of office, industrial, retail, multifamily, hospitality, and student housing, and land properties; CoStar Leasing, a data on lease transactions and tools to manage user-entered lease data; CoStar Sales, a database of commercial real estate sales transactions; CoStar Owners provides detailed portfolio information; CoStar Markets to view and report on market and submarket trends; and CoStar Tenant that provides tenant information. The company also provides hospitality benchmarking that allows hotels to measure performance against competitors; Debt Solutions, a tool for lenders to manage loan portfolios and risk; and real estate and lease management technology solutions, such as lease administration, lease accounting, and transaction management services. In addition, it offers Apartamentos.com, an apartment marketing sites; LoopNet.com, a commercial property marketing sites; Homes.com, a home for sale listings site; Ten-X, an online auction platform for commercial real estate; Land.com, a marketplace for rural land sales; and BizBuySell.com, a marketplace for operating businesses and franchises for sale. It serves sal","summary_zh":"CoStar Group, Inc. 為美國、澳洲、加拿大、歐洲、亞太地區和拉丁美洲的房地產和相關商業界提供資訊、分析和線上市場服務。 CoStar Property 提供辦公、工業、零售、多戶住宅、飯店、學生宿舍以及土地財產的庫存； CoStar Leasing，租賃交易資料和管理使用者輸入租賃資料的工具； CoStar Sales，商業房地產銷售交易資料庫； CoStar Owners 提供詳細的投資組合資訊； CoStar Markets 查看和報告市場和租戶子市場趨勢；以及提供提供租戶資訊的 CoStar Tenant。該公司還提供酒店業基準測試，使酒店能夠衡量競爭對手的業績；債務解決方案，貸款人管理貸款組合和風險的工具；房地產和租賃管理技術解決方案，例如租賃管理、租賃會計和交易管理服務。此外，它還提供Apartamentos.com，一個公寓行銷網站； LoopNet.com，商業房地產行銷網站； Homes.com，一個待售房屋清單網站； Ten-X，商業房地產線上拍賣平台； Land.com，農村土地銷售市場；BizBuySell.com，一個經營企業和出售特許經營權的市場。它提供薩爾","sector_zh":"房地產","industry_zh":"房地產服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":89.16,"h":91.01,"l":87.84,"c":88.06,"v":2826600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":87.88,"h":88.74,"l":87.12,"c":88.14,"v":2625900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":88.26,"h":88.33,"l":85.13,"c":86.3,"v":3254000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":86.48,"h":87.52,"l":86.19,"c":87.06,"v":2322200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":86.68,"h":87.39,"l":86.43,"c":86.8,"v":1261400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":87.14,"h":89.46,"l":87.13,"c":88.97,"v":2954100},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":88.63,"h":88.84,"l":87.22,"c":88.13,"v":2116000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":88.72,"h":90.72,"l":87.78,"c":87.87,"v":3011600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":87.91,"h":89.56,"l":87.51,"c":89.26,"v":2177100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":89.4,"h":89.8,"l":86.92,"c":87.1,"v":5822600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":86.7,"h":86.99,"l":85.27,"c":86.31,"v":2828000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":86.32,"h":86.57,"l":85.06,"c":85.31,"v":3309900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":85.56,"h":85.6,"l":83.86,"c":84.05,"v":2703800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":84.05,"h":84.42,"l":82.91,"c":83.09,"v":3275500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":83.09,"h":84.41,"l":82.79,"c":83.99,"v":3091200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":84.73,"h":84.73,"l":83.66,"c":84.23,"v":2394300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":84.22,"h":84.86,"l":83.15,"c":84.37,"v":3583300